  "html": "<p>Loworld Foundry에서 AI를 사용하는 기본 단위는 <strong>그룹</strong>입니다.</p>\n<p>여기서 한 가지만 먼저 기억하면 나머지가 쉬워집니다.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>그룹은 조직도가 아니라, API 키와 비용을 나누는 단위입니다.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"그룹은-왜-조직도와-다른가\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#그룹은-왜-조직도와-다른가\" class=\"peer\">그룹은 왜 조직도와 다른가</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>그룹마다 AI 모델의 <strong>API 키를 따로 등록</strong>합니다.\n그리고 그 키로 쓴 사용량과 비용이 <strong>그룹 단위로 집계</strong>됩니다.</p>\n<p>즉 그룹을 나눈다는 것은 &quot;누구와 누구를 같은 조직으로 묶을까&quot;가 아니라\n<strong>&quot;어느 단위로 비용을 나눠 볼 것인가&quot;</strong> 를 정하는 일입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"py-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-violet-100 text-violet-800 border border-violet-300 dark:bg-violet-950 dark:text-violet-200 dark:border-violet-700\">그룹</span><span class=\"text-lg text-fd-muted-foreground mx-1\">=</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-300 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-700\">API 키 관리 단위</span><span class=\"text-lg text-fd-muted-foreground mx-1\">=</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-300 dark:bg-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200 dark:border-amber-700\">비용 관리 단위</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed\">그룹별로 서로 다른 API 키를 등록하고, 사용량과 비용이 그룹 단위로 집계됩니다.<!-- --> <strong class=\"text-fd-foreground font-medium\">팀 수와 그룹 수는 다를 수 있습니다.</strong></p><div class=\"bg-fd-muted rounded-lg px-4 py-4 flex items-center gap-6 flex-wrap\"><div><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mb-2 font-medium tracking-wide\">팀 10개</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 max-w-[76px]\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-blue-200 border-blue-300 dark:bg-blue-800 dark:border-blue-600\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-blue-200 border-blue-300 dark:bg-blue-800 dark:border-blue-600\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-blue-200 border-blue-300 dark:bg-blue-800 dark:border-blue-600\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-blue-200 border-blue-300 dark:bg-blue-800 dark:border-blue-600\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-emerald-200 border-emerald-300 dark:bg-emerald-800 dark:border-emerald-600\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-emerald-200 border-emerald-300 dark:bg-emerald-800 dark:border-emerald-600\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-emerald-200 border-emerald-300 dark:bg-emerald-800 dark:border-emerald-600\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-amber-200 border-amber-300 dark:bg-amber-700 dark:border-amber-500\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-amber-200 border-amber-300 dark:bg-amber-700 dark:border-amber-500\"></div><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full border bg-amber-200 border-amber-300 dark:bg-amber-700 dark:border-amber-500\"></div></div></div><div class=\"text-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\">→</div><div><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mb-2 font-medium tracking-wide\">같은 비용 단위끼리 묶으면</div><div class=\"flex gap-1.5 items-center flex-wrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex gap-1 items-center px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:border-blue-700\"><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-300 border border-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-600 dark:border-blue-500\"></span><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-300 border border-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-600 dark:border-blue-500\"></span><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-300 border border-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-600 dark:border-blue-500\"></span><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-300 border border-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-600 dark:border-blue-500\"></span></span><span class=\"inline-flex gap-1 items-center px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:border-emerald-700\"><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-300 border border-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-600 dark:border-emerald-500\"></span><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-300 border border-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-600 dark:border-emerald-500\"></span><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-300 border border-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-600 dark:border-emerald-500\"></span></span><span class=\"inline-flex gap-1 items-center px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-950 dark:border-amber-700\"><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-300 border border-amber-400 dark:bg-amber-600 dark:border-amber-500\"></span><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-300 border border-amber-400 dark:bg-amber-600 dark:border-amber-500\"></span><span class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-300 border border-amber-400 dark:bg-amber-600 dark:border-amber-500\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"text-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\">→</div><div><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1 font-medium\">결과</div><div class=\"text-2xl font-medium text-fd-foreground\">그룹 3개</div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3.5 border border-dashed border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 bg-fd-muted\"><div class=\"text-xs text-fd-muted-foreground mb-1\">그룹 수를 결정할 때 이 질문부터</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-fd-foreground\">&quot;어느 단위로 비용을 나눠 관리할 것인가?&quot;</div></div></div>\n<p>그래서 <strong>실제로 만드는 그룹 수는 회사 조직도보다 적은 경우가 많습니다.</strong>\n팀이 10개여도 비용을 3개 단위로만 나눠 보면 되는 조직이라면, 그룹은 3개면 충분합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>그룹을 몇 개로 나눌지 막막하다면 이 질문부터 던져 보세요.\n<strong>&quot;어느 팀이 각자의 API 키를 따로 가져야 하는가?&quot;</strong>\n답이 &quot;전사가 하나면 된다&quot;라면 그룹 하나로 시작해도 됩니다. 나중에 늘릴 수 있습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"그룹은-계층으로-쌓입니다\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#그룹은-계층으로-쌓입니다\" class=\"peer\">그룹은 계층으로 쌓입니다</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>조직에는 <strong>최상위 그룹이 하나</strong> 있고, 그 아래로 팀·부서 단위 그룹이 나무처럼 뻗어 나갑니다.</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>회사                      ← 최상위 그룹 (하나)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─ 개발본부</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  ├─ 플랫폼팀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  └─ 데이터팀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ 영업본부</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   └─ 영업기획팀</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<p>계층은 <strong>관리 범위</strong>를 정합니다.\n개발본부의 관리자는 그 아래 플랫폼팀·데이터팀까지 함께 관리하지만,\n옆으로 뻗은 영업본부에는 관여하지 않습니다.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"역할은-그룹마다-따로입니다\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#역할은-그룹마다-따로입니다\" class=\"peer\">역할은 그룹마다 따로입니다</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>가장 헷갈리기 쉬운 부분입니다. <strong>역할은 사람이 아니라 &quot;사람 × 그룹&quot;에 붙습니다.</strong></p>\n<p>같은 사람이 여러 그룹에 속하면, 그룹마다 다른 역할을 가질 수 있습니다.</p>\n<figure dir=\"ltr\" class=\"my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"empty:hidden absolute top-2 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground\" aria-label=\"Copy Text\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring\" style=\"--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)\"><pre class=\"min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>이과장</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─ 플랫폼팀   그룹관리자   → 멤버를 추가하고 API 키를 관리할 수 있다</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ 데이터팀   그룹원       → 기본 권한과 추가 역할에 따라 할 수 있는 일이 달라진다</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>\n<p><strong>A 그룹에서 관리자라고 해서 B 그룹까지 관리할 수 있는 것이 아닙니다.</strong>\n단, 위에서 본 계층 때문에 <strong>본인 그룹의 하위 그룹으로는 권한이 내려갑니다.</strong>\n(개발본부 관리자 → 플랫폼팀·데이터팀까지 관리)</p>\n<p>역할은 크게 세 가지입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>역할</th><th>관리 범위</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>조직관리자</strong></td><td>조직 전체의 그룹, 사용자, 역할과 권한 관리</td></tr><tr><td><strong>그룹관리자</strong></td><td>본인 그룹과 그 하위 그룹 관리</td></tr><tr><td><strong>그룹원</strong></td><td>기본 권한과 받은 커스텀 역할로 허용된 기능 사용</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>각 역할이 구체적으로 무엇을 할 수 있는지, 그룹원의 기본 권한을 조직에 맞게 조정하는 방법은\n다음 장 <a href=\"#/onboarding/roles\">역할과 권한 이해하기</a>에서 다룹니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"그룹에서-하는-일\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#그룹에서-하는-일\" class=\"peer\">그룹에서 하는 일</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>그룹을 만들고 나면 조직 관리 화면에서 다음 세 가지를 하게 됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>하는 일</th><th>내용</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>그룹 구성</strong></td><td>조직 구조에 맞게 팀·부서 단위 그룹을 만들고, 수정하고, 삭제합니다</td></tr><tr><td><strong>사람 채우기</strong></td><td>기존 계정을 그룹에 초대하거나, 신규 계정을 직접 만들어 추가합니다</td></tr><tr><td><strong>역할 부여</strong></td><td>각 팀원에게 알맞은 역할을 지정합니다. 필요하면 커스텀 역할을 만들어 씁니다</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"처음-조직을-설정한다면\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#처음-조직을-설정한다면\" class=\"peer\">처음 조직을 설정한다면</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>순서대로 하면 막히지 않습니다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>그룹 만들기</strong>: 비용을 나눠 볼 단위를 기준으로 만듭니다. 조직도를 그대로 옮기지 않아도 됩니다.</li>\n<li><strong>사용자 초대 / 계정 생성</strong>: 그룹에 사람을 채웁니다.</li>\n<li><strong>역할 할당</strong>: 그룹을 관리할 사람을 지정합니다.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>1단계에서 완벽한 구조를 만들려고 오래 고민하지 마세요.\n그룹은 나중에 추가·이동할 수 있습니다. <strong>하나로 시작해서 필요할 때 나누는 편이 빠릅니다.</strong></p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"다음-단계\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#다음-단계\" class=\"peer\">다음 단계</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 @container\"><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/onboarding/roles\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">역할과 권한 이해하기</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>조직관리자 · 그룹관리자 · 그룹원이 각각 할 수 있는 일</p></div></a></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>실제 그룹을 만들고 팀원을 추가하는 방법은 상세 문서에서 다룹니다.\n<a href=\"#/detail/organization/manage-group\">하위 그룹 만들기</a> · <a href=\"#/detail/organization/org-chart\">전체 조직도</a></p></div></div></div>"
}